MID_MV11_09_m003: (gasp)
MID_MV11_09_m004: Tialla?
MID_MV11_09_m005: Guai a voi se le fate del male!
MID_MV11_09_m006: (charging and firing exerts)
MID_MV11_09_m007: (pained exert)
MID_MV11_09_m008: (pained exert)
MID_MV11_09_m009: (pained exert)
MID_MV11_09_m010: (gasp)
MID_MV11_09_m011: (growl)
MID_MV11_09_m012: (gasp)
MID_MV11_09_m013: Non penso proprio!
